e=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond%20Arena\">Svargrond Arena</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tExtremely fast<br/><br/>A spirit of water attacks in melee range. A spirit of water never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTreat it like a strong water elemental. For all vocations it is wise to use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> since this will block the drown damage.<br/><b>Mages</b>: Run around using an energy wand/death rod shooting energy strike. Heal often. Without <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a>, use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> and kill with SD as fast as you can, or you will be dead very quickly. <br/><b>Knights</b>: Melee and Exori trying to keep your HP constantly full.<br/><b>Paladins</b>: Use a Shield and Ethereal Spear, bring plenty <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Healing%20Rune\">UHs</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hydro-Elementals\">Hydro-Elementals</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Elemental\">Angry Elemental</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Foam%20Stalker\">Foam Stalker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Font%20of%20Refreshment\">Font of Refreshment</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Water%20Elemental\">Massive Water Elemental</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Roaring%20Water%20Elemental\">Roaring Water Elemental</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Slick%20Water%20Elemental\">Slick Water Elemental</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spirit%20of%20Fertility\">Spirit of Fertility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Venerable%20Foam%20Stalker\">Venerable Foam Stalker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Elemental\">Water Elemental</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["barbarian-arena-quest"]}